00:24:12.500 --> 00:24:16.340
and help you overcome challenges
in the cloud migration space

00:24:16.340 --> 00:24:18.410
or in the process of
planning your migration

00:24:18.410 --> 00:24:21.870
as an organization as well as
executing on your migrations.

00:24:21.870 --> 00:24:24.800
So, as we go through
this, one of the things

00:24:24.800 --> 00:24:27.870
