00:27:09.930 --> 00:27:11.990
Am I actually saving
money going to cloud?

00:27:11.990 --> 00:27:13.865
The platform we'll pick
the products for you.

00:27:13.865 --> 00:27:14.960
It'll load it for you.

00:27:14.960 --> 00:27:17.270
And most importantly, it's
