private data center benchmarks,

00:27:24.830 --> 00:27:26.990
and make sure that
you're actually

00:27:26.990 --> 00:27:28.640
saving money going into cloud.

00:27:28.640 --> 00:27:30.590
Not every use case
may work for you.

00:27:30.590 --> 00:27:32.990
And those use cases
that do work for you,

00:27:32.990 --> 00:27:36.140
you have to be able to
justify that up and sideways

00:27:36.140 --> 00:27:37.560
in the organization.

00:27:37.560 --> 00:27:39.350
So what do we do for you there?

00:27:39.350 --> 00:27:42.290
In the TCO, ROI in
the financial space,

00:27:42.290 --> 00:27:44.180
we have a benchmark
