00:27:44.180 --> 00:27:45.050
It's certified.

00:27:45.050 --> 00:27:47.270
It avoids you having
to pick your own costs

00:27:47.270 --> 00:27:49.910
for the organization
and go find your costs.

00:27:49.910 --> 00:27:52.592
If you do want to bring
