00:27:58.040 --> 00:27:59.440
to compare the right side to.

00:27:59.440 --> 00:27:59.940
Right.

00:27:59.940 --> 00:28:02.240
We need your private data
center costs in order

00:28:02.240 --> 00:28:03.750
to compare that to the cloud.

00:28:03.750 --> 00:28:07.010
So when you start looking at
