00:28:33.860 --> 00:28:36.560
And then the other, like I said,
the big important thing here

00:28:36.560 --> 00:28:39.050
about making sure you
know what you're doing

00:28:39.050 --> 00:28:40.700
is a consumable roadmap.

00:28:40.700 --> 00:28:43.700
That consumable roadmap has to
have small enough pieces that

00:28:43.700 --> 00:28:45.590
can be executed
