00:28:56.640 --> 00:28:59.470
Start out with small successes
and move to the next steps.

00:28:59.470 --> 00:29:02.165
And then, the last thing here,
a predictable migration cost.

00:29:02.165 --> 00:29:04.540
That's one of the biggest
shortcomings of cloud migration

00:29:04.540 --> 00:29:05.310
